  "g3_not_applicable_reason": "G3 (random-menu/random-calendar placebo) does not apply to a fixed-proportion or inverse-volatility portfolio-combination question: there is no discretionary asset pick or gate-timing signal to randomize. The volatility-matched delevered-S3 control (Ci) is the placebo-equivalent check here -- it isolates 'same risk, no diversification' so that any Mi advantage must come from genuine cross-sleeve diversification, not from running at higher average risk.",
